{"text": " Ako rand\u017ee \u010det\u010die pity nen\u00ed zdroje, ale soj\u010d hend\u017eem, ktor\u00fd projde b\u00fdhem par v tenem v\u0161echny zdroje. I ty tvoje. \u010cet\u010die pity. \u010co sp\u00f4sobu je rast svalou. Hypertrofia, silov\u00fd tr\u00e9nik. Pritsv\u00ed\u010den\u00ed zoz\u00e1\u0165a\u017eov znikaj\u00fa v svalov\u00fdch vl\u00e1knach mikrotrhniny. \u010celo ich po\u010das regener\u00e1cie opravy a zo siln\u00fd svali ve\u010di a silni\u0161i. Skoro ja keby bol internet pln\u00fd dezinform\u00e1cii, a \u010det\u010die pity je bol odnovrny zdroj inform\u00e1cii.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 13.0, "text": " Ako rand\u017ee \u010det\u010die pity nen\u00ed zdroje, ale soj\u010d hend\u017eem, ktor\u00fd projde b\u00fdhem par v tenem v\u0161echny zdroje.", "tokens": [50364, 316, 4093, 367, 474, 29913, 22392, 302, 10236, 414, 280, 507, 16399, 870, 16221, 340, 2884, 11, 6775, 370, 73, 10236, 276, 521, 9159, 443, 11, 350, 21151, 11822, 447, 73, 1479, 272, 11822, 28005, 971, 371, 2064, 443, 371, 42717, 1377, 88, 16221, 340, 2884, 13, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.5775337673368908, "compression_ratio": 1.1870503597122302, "no_speech_prob": 0.3315294086933136}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 13.0, "end": 15.0, "text": " I ty tvoje.", "tokens": [51014, 286, 1104, 256, 3080, 2884, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.5775337673368908, "compression_ratio": 1.1870503597122302, "no_speech_prob": 0.3315294086933136}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 15.0, "end": 17.0, "text": " \u010cet\u010die pity.", "tokens": [51114, 2127, 234, 302, 10236, 414, 280, 507, 13, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.5775337673368908, "compression_ratio": 1.1870503597122302, "no_speech_prob": 0.3315294086933136}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 19.0, "end": 26.0, "text": " \u010co sp\u00f4sobu je rast svalou.", "tokens": [51314, 2127, 234, 78, 637, 2851, 539, 6021, 1506, 367, 525, 262, 3337, 263, 13, 51664], "temperatu